<title>AUSTRALIA: Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - May 30.</title>
<headline>Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - May 30.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twenty highest dividend yields for Australian companies included in the 320-share All Ordinaries Index based on closing prices on Thursday.</p>
<p>Dividends based on rolling 12 months.</p>
<p>Yields are not grossed up for franking credits.</p>
<p>					   Dividend</p>
<p>Rank Name		     Yield    Close</p>
<p> 1   Centro Prop	    15.72    2.21</p>
<p> 2   Mt Leyshon Gold	12.69    1.97</p>
<p> 3   Aust Tour		 9.62    0.78</p>
<p> 4   Prime Credit Tr	 9.59    1.02</p>
<p> 5   Prop Income Inv	 9.09    1.11</p>
<p> 6   Natl Consol	     9.00    1.00</p>
<p> 7   Cudgen R.Z.	     8.93    2.80</p>
<p> 8   BT Prop Trust	   8.77    1.86</p>
<p> 9   Indu Property	   8.58    0.99</p>
<p>10   Schroder Prop	   8.53    2.17</p>
<p>11   Colonial Mutual	 8.46    1.26</p>
<p>12   Natl In Prop	    8.35    1.05</p>
<p>13   Equitilink		8.33    0.60</p>
<p>14   Ipoh			8.33    2.16</p>
<p>15   Gandel Retail Tr	8.22    0.95</p>
<p>16   Colonial Coml	   8.18    2.26</p>
<p>17   Hills Inds		8.14    2.10</p>
